# ユーザ環境設定's pages, their links and their 写し (docs/tessronos 11.6), for tools/ui_run.py as
# ui_sysenv_page.steps. Opened with the data of a page, the window shows that sheet; run again with
# another, the same window turns to it. 写しを作る of 〈表示属性〉 makes a copy of the sheet's look's
# lines; opened, it shows them and asks, and 設定 sets them. The window is at 180,90, its menu
# opened at 400,300.
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53 {"tessronos-userenv":{"data":"display"}}
expect userenv: opened with data "display"
expect userenv: page "display"
expect userenv: ready
wait 800
shot uc_display
logmark
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53 {"tessronos-userenv":{"data":"pointer"}}
expectsince userenv: page "pointer"
nwin ユーザ環境設定
want ok 1
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53 {"tessronos-userenv":{"data":"display"}}
expectsince userenv: page "display"
wait 500
click 400 300 1
wait 500
shot uc_menu
move 410 400
wait 150
move 430 420
wait 150
click 430 420
expect userenv: copy of "user.display" made, 10 lines (0)
expect desktop: link put "ユーザ環境設定（表示属性）の写し"
wait 800
# the copy opened: the sheet's values as they are, nothing differs; 設定 sets them all the same
logmark
openput
expectsince userenv: copy of "user.display" opened, 10 lines, 0 differ
wait 800
shot uc_ask
click 776 451
expectsince userenv: copy of "user.display" set
wait 500
nwin ユーザ環境設定
want ok 1
absent !OACV!
